## 11. Security and Abuse Prevention

Implement:
- Authentication and authorization on protected endpoints.
- Server-side role checks.
- Atomic card registration.
- Atomic game start.
- Duplicate-call prevention.
- Duplicate-claim prevention.
- Server-authoritative game state.
- Request validation and rate limits.
- Secure random number generation.
- Persistent card-block records.
- Audit logging for host actions and claims.

